;   accuracy_curve_direct_howitz_220m           accuracy_curve_direct_howitz           220   220   3.1     2.53
;   accuracy_curve_direct_howitz_220m_anti_far  accuracy_curve_direct_howitz_anti_far  220   220   3.1     2.53
;   accuracy_curve_2                            (base)
